# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit real values.
# Everything prefixed VITE_ is read at BUILD time and shipped to the browser.
#
# Visitor Wall (Supabase). Leave both empty to run the in-tab mock wall ("Offline preview").
# The wall uses Supabase only when BOTH are set.
#   VITE_SUPABASE_URL      Project Settings > API > Project URL
#   VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY the anon / publishable key. NEVER the service_role or secret key.
# Setup steps (migration, auth settings, redirect URLs, moderator): README.md "Supabase setup"
# and supabase/seed/admin.sql. Moderators sign in at /?mod.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
#
# Public site URL, no trailing slash. Used for <link rel="canonical">, og:url and the JSON-LD
# Person url. Empty = https://jewoo-lee.vercel.app. Set it when a custom domain is attached.
VITE_SITE_URL=
